<div class="container-mission-vision">
    <div class="mission">
        <h2 data-i18n="main-our-mission-title">Our Mission</h2>
        <p data-i18n="main-our-mission-desc">To empower communities and develop holistic minded leaders through programs that will help the poor overcome poverty and develop people’s values, skills and leadership potentials.   </p>
    </div>

    <div class="vision">
        <h2 data-i18n="main-our-vision-title">Our Vision</h2>
        <p data-i18n="main-our-vision-desc">Communities of people living purposeful and productive lives with integrity, and genuinely caring for others and their environment.</p>
    </div>
</div>


