<div class="our-beneficiaries-text" data-i18n="main-our-beneficiaries-title">
    Our Beneficiaries
</div>

<div class="container-beneficiaries">
    <div class="card card-bgl" style="width: 20rem;">
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="images/main_bgl.jpeg" class="card-img-top" alt="Main Page - Batang Gift of Love">
            <a href="/batang-gift-of-love" class="btn" data-i18n="main-our-beneficiaries-learnmore">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">Batang Gift of Love</h5>
            <p class="card-text" data-i18n="main-our-beneficiaries-bgl">We envision Batang Gift of Love to be role models of their communities. We hope that all children will have the capacity to finish their education and achieve financial stability in the future.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-lm" style="width: 20rem;">
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="images/main_lm.jpeg" class="card-img-top" alt="Main Page - Likhang Maharlika">
            <a href="/likhang-maharlika" class="btn" data-i18n="main-our-beneficiaries-learnmore">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">Likhang Maharlika</h5>
            <p class="card-text" data-i18n="main-our-beneficiaries-lm">We make handcrafted products, such as paper quilling products, recycled wallets, and other sustainable products. Through the creation of these products, we aim to preserve the essence or culture.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-gg" style="width: 20rem;">
        <div class="image-container"> 
            <img src="images/main_gg.jpeg" class="card-img-top" alt="Main Page - Gift Global">
            <a href="/gift-global" class="btn" data-i18n="main-our-beneficiaries-learnmore">Learn More</a>
        </div> 
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">Gift Global</h5>
            <p class="card-text" data-i18n="main-our-beneficiaries-gg">We are dedicated in uplifting the lives of vulnerable children by supporting their physical, education, and spiritual needs through our various programs.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

